# A puck's Wi-Fi list. Copy to ~/wg-tunnels/pucks/<puck>/wifi.conf (or tpk-ctl.sh
# new makes it; tpk-ctl.sh keeps it mode 600: it holds passwords), then:
#   scripts/tpk-ctl.sh <puck> wifi sync          (tpk-ctl.sh <puck> all syncs it too)
#
# One network per line, name::password, most preferred first. Only the first ::
# splits, so a password may hold anything; spaces count, at the ends too. An
# empty password is an open network. Among networks in range, the puck joins the
# highest on the list; ethernet still wins when plugged in. Networks tunnel-puck
# saved before that aren't here are removed on sync.
#
# MomsHouse::hunter2hunter2
# MomsHouse-5G::hunter2hunter2
# CafeGuest::
